WEBVTT

00:02.576 --> 00:04.201
Die!

00:04.388 --> 00:07.008
Order. Shoot it to death, Alma.

00:07.136 --> 00:08.096
Got it.

00:09.920 --> 00:12.032
Accel Duodecuple!

00:24.016 --> 00:26.192
Assassin Skill. Phantom.

00:26.704 --> 00:29.328
This is a skill Alma gained upon ranking up.

00:29.500 --> 00:33.504
Once every 24 hours, the user can
become incorporeal for three seconds,

00:33.504 --> 00:35.920
nullifying any physical contact.

00:36.768 --> 00:38.304
Quick Attack!

00:49.888 --> 00:52.096
Battle complete.

00:53.152 --> 00:54.960
Alright!

00:55.552 --> 00:57.296
Now I get to be B-Rank!

00:57.440 --> 00:59.472
You can't call me a burden anymore!

01:00.032 --> 01:01.344
Check it out!

01:01.568 --> 01:02.336
Ugh.

01:04.192 --> 01:04.832
Noel…

01:05.152 --> 01:05.888
You…

01:07.168 --> 01:09.056
Did you know the whole time?

01:09.664 --> 01:14.448
Yeah. I set the scene with this outcome in mind.

01:15.952 --> 01:19.504
I pushed the guild to set up this competition.

01:20.016 --> 01:25.424
And I chose the Dantalion because
my skills are a good match for it.

01:25.920 --> 01:27.760
I even sent those fake letters…

01:27.760 --> 01:29.728
You!

01:30.176 --> 01:31.952
But it wasn't all me.

01:32.416 --> 01:35.760
You yourselves also factored into this.

01:36.400 --> 01:39.120
You've wanted to be free, haven't you?

01:41.392 --> 01:43.136
You're strong people.

01:43.344 --> 01:45.968
But Leon is the only gifted one.

01:46.656 --> 01:50.384
Your name, the Winged Knights, only reflects Leon.

01:51.360 --> 01:55.792
You're accessories to him.
Nothing more than interchangeable somebodies.

01:56.896 --> 01:59.264
Envy would get in your way.

01:59.568 --> 02:04.816
You kept it bottled up,
and it rotted your hearts from the inside.

02:05.440 --> 02:08.384
I only gave you the final nudge.

02:08.928 --> 02:13.072
Your party was always fated to fall apart.

02:14.944 --> 02:17.008
Any friendship, any bond…

02:18.144 --> 02:21.632
All it takes is a subtle crack
to make it crumble to pieces.

02:23.728 --> 02:26.144
You think your friends betrayed you?

02:27.232 --> 02:30.976
You're wrong. You're the one
who betrayed them, Leon.

02:31.488 --> 02:36.384
You brought this on yourself because you
couldn't fully trust your friend when it counted.

02:38.576 --> 02:41.072
Good work, all of you.

02:42.048 --> 02:44.992
I've been watching the entire time.

02:46.432 --> 02:48.608
The victor is Blue Beyond.

02:49.328 --> 02:52.320
Your party is approved as a clan.

02:53.072 --> 03:00.032
In accordance with the agreement,
the Winged Knights must immediately disband.

04:40.384 --> 04:42.576
Extra! Extra!

04:44.656 --> 04:47.136
Seriously?

04:47.328 --> 04:48.832
The Winged Knights…

04:49.184 --> 04:51.856
I kinda looked up to them.

04:52.128 --> 04:54.032
That damn Noel.

04:54.208 --> 04:57.648
So this is what he's been doing
while he's been away from the bar.

04:58.080 --> 05:00.128
Hey, Zeke, what's wrong?

05:00.512 --> 05:02.640
Let's go eat.

05:03.856 --> 05:04.800
Interesting.

05:10.016 --> 05:14.000
I put in so much work,
and I thought I'd gotten stronger.

05:15.120 --> 05:17.408
But I wasn't actually strong at all.

05:20.784 --> 05:22.000
I'm exhausted.

05:23.408 --> 05:25.024
Ophelia…

05:25.792 --> 05:28.000
Don't take your friends for granted.

05:35.680 --> 05:42.496
May I take it that your paying a visit
means you'll be accepting my offer?

05:44.672 --> 05:47.168
Veronica Redbone of Red Lotus.

05:47.840 --> 05:49.984
I look forward to working with you.

05:52.240 --> 05:54.016
You've done a bad thing.

05:54.624 --> 05:59.648
The Winged Knights were one of the few
upstanding parties in this industry.

05:59.936 --> 06:02.800
They were already strained.

06:03.328 --> 06:05.632
I just made them aware of it.

06:05.952 --> 06:08.608
What did you say to bring them down?

06:09.328 --> 06:11.136
That I'd free them.

06:12.016 --> 06:13.936
Just like me.

06:14.224 --> 06:18.304
But I can't see your methods
convincing him to join you.

06:18.576 --> 06:20.624
He will. I'm sure of it.

06:21.152 --> 06:23.392
I never let my prey escape.

06:25.136 --> 06:29.120
So I'm going to free you too,
and you're going to join me.

06:29.552 --> 06:31.232
You're wasting your time.

06:31.584 --> 06:35.696
I regret to inform you,
I'm relentless like a snake.

06:38.608 --> 06:40.304
A snake, huh…

06:42.704 --> 06:43.744
One more.

06:44.112 --> 06:46.912
I'll stop you there. You've had enough to drink.

06:47.568 --> 06:50.336
Keim, you're still young.

06:50.656 --> 06:53.216
- There are plenty of ways you could start fresh.

06:53.216 --> 06:54.544
- No. There aren't.
- There are plenty of ways you could start fresh.

06:55.840 --> 07:00.528
I can still feel Leon's blood on my hands.

07:03.504 --> 07:08.816
All he wanted to do was protect me.
To protect his friends.

07:09.072 --> 07:12.256
He made the most right choice
he could in that situation.

07:12.912 --> 07:13.888
But I…

07:15.808 --> 07:18.176
I'm the traitor.

07:19.600 --> 07:23.024
It's true. You've done something
you can't take back.

07:23.504 --> 07:27.712
But drowning your sorrows won't fix anything.

07:29.520 --> 07:32.688
There's something else you need to do more.

07:33.328 --> 07:34.704
What's that?

07:36.160 --> 07:38.368
Set Leon free.

07:40.128 --> 07:42.000
He's already free.

07:42.640 --> 07:44.832
The Winged Knights broke up.

07:45.888 --> 07:47.296
That's not what I mean.

07:47.760 --> 07:50.528
He must be doing the same thing as you.

07:51.008 --> 07:53.984
Blaming himself for not trusting his friend,

07:54.240 --> 07:56.256
worrying, stressing himself out,

07:56.256 --> 07:58.272
being held prisoner to his feelings.

07:59.520 --> 08:01.744
So you need to set him free.

08:02.464 --> 08:06.896
For Leon to take flight
once more on his heavensent wings,

08:07.984 --> 08:11.184
you need to sever the chains that bind him.

08:11.968 --> 08:14.960
You're the only one who can do it, Keim.

08:15.440 --> 08:17.696
He's your little brother, isn't he?

08:23.056 --> 08:25.776
Congrats on your party disbanding.

08:26.528 --> 08:30.432
I've been waiting for you to end up alone.

08:30.912 --> 08:33.296
Edgar of War Eagle…

08:33.792 --> 08:34.656
Why?

08:35.040 --> 08:36.464
Why?

08:36.688 --> 08:40.752
Because I can't stand how you act, you hypocrite!

08:41.600 --> 08:43.744
You'd never kill a man?

08:44.464 --> 08:46.656
Get off your high horse!

08:47.200 --> 08:52.720
Do you know how much we've been mocked
while everyone fawned over you?

08:54.144 --> 08:56.304
You wouldn't know, huh?

08:56.304 --> 08:59.504
Not the squeaky-clean Winged Knight!

09:00.688 --> 09:04.448
Now you've lost both your friends and your pride!

09:04.576 --> 09:07.200
Serves you right to drop dead now!

09:13.616 --> 09:16.928
Looks like you're having fun, Edgar.

09:17.936 --> 09:20.208
Let us join in.

09:21.040 --> 09:24.048
[XII - This Snake Has Wings]

09:26.688 --> 09:28.608
What're you doing?!

09:28.912 --> 09:31.040
Taking a walk. Isn't that right?

09:31.040 --> 09:32.432
A walk, yep.

09:32.432 --> 09:33.312
A walk.

09:33.536 --> 09:35.104
Obviously not!

09:35.104 --> 09:37.776
You're in the way! Get lost!

09:37.776 --> 09:39.520
Who do you think you're ordering around?

09:40.400 --> 09:43.152
Learn your place, small fry.

09:43.872 --> 09:47.744
I don't like you. I don't like you one bit.

09:48.256 --> 09:50.608
Who're you calling a small fry?!

09:51.440 --> 09:54.016
I won't just stand here and let you insult me!

09:54.368 --> 09:56.032
Get them, guys!

09:56.320 --> 09:58.416
Y-You've gotta be kidding.

09:58.416 --> 10:00.864
These guys beat the Winged Knights.

10:04.272 --> 10:06.080
Hey! Guys!

10:06.080 --> 10:10.009
Looks like you aren't very popular, Edgar.

10:16.800 --> 10:18.192
Look at me.

10:19.968 --> 10:22.432
Look at me!

10:22.528 --> 10:24.384
Get this through your thick skull.

10:24.640 --> 10:27.376
Never act like such a cocky asshole again!

10:27.872 --> 10:34.480
If you break that promise, I'll give
all your friends and family the same look as you!

10:35.888 --> 10:38.416
I-I understand!

10:38.992 --> 10:40.816
Go. Don't make me tell you again.

10:41.024 --> 10:43.472
Y-Yes, sir!

10:46.688 --> 10:49.808
Now, Leon. Let's talk business.

10:51.632 --> 10:53.120
Get serious!

10:53.616 --> 10:55.200
I am serious.

10:55.584 --> 10:59.312
If you'll join me, I'll let you
be vice-master of my clan.

10:59.696 --> 11:01.264
Not a bad deal, right?

11:01.536 --> 11:03.440
I'd never join you!

11:03.728 --> 11:05.100
If not for you guys…

11:05.100 --> 11:06.432
No, Noel…

11:07.344 --> 11:09.120
If not for you…

11:09.360 --> 11:11.296
The Winged Knights could have won?

11:11.648 --> 11:13.200
You really believe that?

11:14.848 --> 11:20.544
Leon, as leader of the Winged Knights,
you were only able to be righteous and upstanding

11:21.232 --> 11:23.840
because of your members' hard work and loyalty.

11:25.472 --> 11:29.104
But no matter how hard they worked,

11:29.392 --> 11:31.488
they could never catch up with your gift.

11:32.176 --> 11:36.016
As they strived in vain, they grew discontent.

11:36.448 --> 11:39.488
The party was never going to last long.

11:41.040 --> 11:42.224
I know.

11:43.296 --> 11:44.704
Even if you hadn't come along,

11:45.712 --> 11:47.520
we had no future.

11:48.576 --> 11:55.760
But acknowledging that would mean saying
that everything we did was pointless.

11:57.424 --> 12:00.112
I can't bear to do that!

12:00.976 --> 12:03.040
Will you stop fighting?

12:03.712 --> 12:05.216
Fighting for what?

12:06.464 --> 12:08.176
I can't get back what I lost.

12:08.352 --> 12:09.824
No, you can.

12:11.392 --> 12:16.304
The Winged Knights' glory will be
a thing of the past if you give up.

12:16.784 --> 12:18.528
No. The world is crueler than that.

12:18.928 --> 12:21.744
There'll be nothing left of the party
but a dishonorable name,

12:22.432 --> 12:24.336
and even that will fade in no time.

12:25.856 --> 12:30.512
But if you made a name for yourself as a Seeker,

12:30.832 --> 12:34.096
the Winged Knights name could live on.

12:34.640 --> 12:39.296
If I joined you, that would
make me a true traitor.

12:39.536 --> 12:41.648
Be selfish, Leon.

12:42.704 --> 12:44.816
Stop being sentimental.

12:45.488 --> 12:49.792
It won't help you or your friends.

12:50.848 --> 12:53.856
If you want what you value
most to remain for eternity,

12:54.304 --> 12:56.560
then be willing to throw everything else away!

12:58.912 --> 13:02.400
Noel, what drives you as a Seeker?

13:03.792 --> 13:08.320
To prove to the world
that I'm the greatest Seeker.

13:09.888 --> 13:12.512
Can I take your word on that?

13:12.976 --> 13:16.080
If it turns out you're lying,
I'll never forgive you.

13:17.152 --> 13:18.256
That's a silly question.

13:26.704 --> 13:31.520
Your fave fights pretty dirty, Gramps.

13:32.016 --> 13:36.944
I can't believe he crushed
his rival party to take their leader.

13:38.112 --> 13:43.488
But thanks to that, we've gained
a more promising team.

13:44.160 --> 13:48.336
It will also let Leon use
his capabilities to their fullest.

13:48.784 --> 13:50.896
I think you're biased.

13:53.152 --> 13:56.960
Whether or not they survive depends on them.

13:57.120 --> 14:01.808
In order to judge them better,
I've given them another quest.

14:02.672 --> 14:04.320
You don't mean…

14:05.136 --> 14:10.288
The target manifested the other day
in the Quartz Valley at a Depth of 9.

14:10.704 --> 14:15.088
The ghost-controlling wolf, the Garmr.

14:16.288 --> 14:17.600
For real?

14:18.992 --> 14:19.872
Look.

14:20.304 --> 14:21.712
It's Noel and Leon.

14:21.952 --> 14:24.336
So it's true that they joined up.

14:24.752 --> 14:27.210
Leon ditched his other members like that?

14:27.210 --> 14:30.768
I guess even a noble knight
puts himself first in the end.

14:30.768 --> 14:31.952
I'm disappointed.

14:32.464 --> 14:34.160
I can't believe him.

14:35.312 --> 14:37.024
Don't let it get to you.

14:38.208 --> 14:40.544
Better to be infamous than never famous at all.

14:41.072 --> 14:42.240
Don't worry about it.

14:42.432 --> 14:45.200
Once you prove yourself, whatever people say…

14:45.200 --> 14:46.496
Noel Stollen!

14:47.872 --> 14:49.392
You demon!

14:49.808 --> 14:52.528
This is all your fault…

14:52.528 --> 14:54.528
I'll kill you!

14:54.576 --> 14:55.632
Stop, Keim!

14:56.224 --> 14:57.968
What would that accomplish?

14:58.208 --> 15:00.080
This won't end well for you!

15:00.080 --> 15:01.728
Shut up, traitor!

15:02.064 --> 15:02.992
You're right.

15:03.424 --> 15:04.832
I'm a traitor!

15:05.184 --> 15:06.784
So I won't let you kill Noel!

15:07.104 --> 15:08.880
Hey, they're gonna fight.

15:08.896 --> 15:11.264
The black-haired guy is his old friend, right?

15:11.872 --> 15:12.992
In that case…

15:13.456 --> 15:16.064
I'll have to kill you first!

15:28.112 --> 15:29.840
Whoa! One hit!

15:30.112 --> 15:32.928
They don't call him the Winged Knight for nothing.

15:32.928 --> 15:34.800
He didn't even draw his sword.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.344
I won't justify myself.

15:38.992 --> 15:40.704
I'm following my own path.

15:44.064 --> 15:45.872
Good luck, Leon.

15:50.064 --> 15:50.928
Don't turn around!

15:51.808 --> 15:53.216
Don't turn around, Leon.

15:54.064 --> 15:56.320
Leave your brother some dignity.

15:58.256 --> 16:00.064
This is an order. We're going.

16:01.824 --> 16:03.904
Yeah. Let's go, master.

16:04.608 --> 16:05.728
That's right.

16:06.672 --> 16:08.960
Move forward and don't look back, Leon.

16:10.896 --> 16:15.168
Keep flying with those wings you were given.

16:22.416 --> 16:24.928
This is our clan house.

16:25.984 --> 16:29.792
It was only twenty million fil. Good deal, right?

16:30.336 --> 16:31.808
Twenty million?!

16:31.808 --> 16:32.960
Impossible.

16:32.960 --> 16:33.760
No way!

16:34.208 --> 16:35.568
I remember now.

16:35.856 --> 16:39.184
This used to be an execution site.

16:39.744 --> 16:40.608
That's right.

16:40.608 --> 16:44.288
Everyone who's lived here has been
tormented by unexplained phenomena.

16:44.288 --> 16:46.480
It's a haunted house.

16:46.768 --> 16:48.592
That's why it was such a good deal.

16:49.552 --> 16:52.080
But don't worry. I have this.

16:52.688 --> 16:55.472
This is a skill book for Exorcism.

16:56.288 --> 17:00.720
It can immediately wipe out
any undead-type enemies at or below my level.

17:01.408 --> 17:03.264
Human ghosts should be a piece of cake.

17:04.960 --> 17:08.176
Alright, that settles that discussion.

17:09.504 --> 17:11.760
Each of you gets one of these.

17:14.288 --> 17:16.400
A snake with wings?

17:16.592 --> 17:18.016
Why snakes?

17:19.056 --> 17:23.504
Snakes have symbolized immortality
and prosperity since ancient times.

17:24.048 --> 17:28.992
At the same time, they've been
feared as deceivers of men.

17:30.080 --> 17:32.848
I think that duality suits us.

17:33.568 --> 17:36.640
Good and evil. Light and dark.

17:36.960 --> 17:41.616
We'll go back and forth between
those different attributes on our way to the top.

17:42.272 --> 17:44.960
Our clan application has been accepted.

17:45.616 --> 17:47.968
Our new name will be fitting of winged snakes.

17:48.432 --> 17:52.160
We will be known as Wild Tempest.

18:05.120 --> 18:07.824
I knew it could resummon its underlings,

18:08.240 --> 18:11.712
but this is too much for Exorcism to handle.

18:13.488 --> 18:14.784
What do we do, Noel?

18:14.784 --> 18:17.840
It's dodging my attacks like it's nothing.

18:17.840 --> 18:19.424
The Garmr is intelligent.

18:19.840 --> 18:21.904
It's waiting for us to get tired.

18:22.048 --> 18:23.168
If we don't do something…

18:23.808 --> 18:25.632
Alma, Koga, back Leon up!

18:25.856 --> 18:28.736
Leon, get ready to use Seraphim Blade!

18:28.736 --> 18:29.840
I can't, master!

18:29.840 --> 18:30.752
If I use that…

18:30.848 --> 18:33.248
Just do it! That's an order!

18:34.320 --> 18:35.744
Crazy Cherry Blossoms!

18:37.120 --> 18:38.816
Perfect Throw!

18:39.470 --> 18:40.702
[Spirit Purification]
Exorcism!

18:43.632 --> 18:44.896
Now! Use it!

18:45.152 --> 18:47.600
Seraphim Blade!

19:09.184 --> 19:11.392
So this is it.

19:11.936 --> 19:13.680
Sorry, Noel.

19:14.048 --> 19:16.560
I can't keep going…

19:28.864 --> 19:32.128
This has been quite fun.

19:32.624 --> 19:34.976
146 seconds.

19:35.152 --> 19:38.992
Son of man, I shall devour you.

19:38.992 --> 19:39.648
Wait!

19:40.896 --> 19:42.240
I accept defeat.

19:42.880 --> 19:45.856
But there's only so much
you can gain by eating me.

19:47.776 --> 19:49.440
Want to make a deal instead?

19:49.824 --> 19:51.488
A deal?

19:52.272 --> 19:55.120
If you let us go, I'll tell you something.

19:55.820 --> 19:59.712
It'll come in handy to know.

20:00.000 --> 20:01.888
What do you have?

20:02.800 --> 20:04.368
This is a mister.

20:04.880 --> 20:07.728
It releases whatever liquid
you put inside as a mist.

20:09.728 --> 20:12.864
What good would that be?

20:13.056 --> 20:14.368
It's plenty useful.

20:14.800 --> 20:17.968
I imagine it's starting to kick in about now.

20:20.544 --> 20:22.176
You…!

20:22.176 --> 20:24.400
Don't move more than you have to.

20:24.400 --> 20:26.112
You'll make the poison circulate.

20:26.112 --> 20:28.288
Poison…?

20:28.288 --> 20:29.792
Blood Poison.

20:31.088 --> 20:34.240
It's a toxin made from my own blood.

20:34.480 --> 20:39.184
It has no taste or scent,
and it paralyzes within minutes once inhaled.

20:40.032 --> 20:44.048
And it's specially made for beasts.

20:44.240 --> 20:48.016
Your puny poison cannot…

20:49.504 --> 20:53.059
That's right. We pretended to
lose so we could lure you here,

20:53.060 --> 20:57.216
where the poison is concentrated.

20:57.504 --> 21:01.312
It was all a facade…?

21:01.312 --> 21:04.720
Not all! My broken bones are real!

21:04.720 --> 21:05.520
Ow…

21:05.520 --> 21:07.232
You're a devil, Noel.

21:07.232 --> 21:09.376
We were almost dead meat there.

21:09.600 --> 21:11.467
I thought you were crazy when you said

21:11.468 --> 21:15.376
we should let it nearly kill
us to make sure it falls for it.

21:15.856 --> 21:17.504
42 seconds left.

21:18.880 --> 21:21.824
Skeleton Knights…!

21:21.824 --> 21:25.696
It's no use. You can't summon
your underlings like this.

21:26.240 --> 21:29.472
The poison's already spread throughout your body.

21:29.808 --> 21:35.712
All because you played along with our charade
and used up all your MP.

21:36.080 --> 21:39.056
That's what you get for underestimating a Talker.

21:39.552 --> 21:43.104
How cunning…

21:43.360 --> 21:46.352
How bold…

21:51.648 --> 21:55.088
Well done!

21:57.520 --> 21:59.600
146 seconds sharp.

22:00.528 --> 22:02.688
Battle complete.

22:06.048 --> 22:12.032
I've confirmed the beast has been defeated
and the Abyss purified.

22:13.248 --> 22:17.232
This should spread your party's name even further.

22:18.096 --> 22:20.160
I'm not satisfied yet.

22:20.736 --> 22:23.552
We're aiming higher than this.

22:24.496 --> 22:26.080
Higher?

22:26.528 --> 22:27.968
For regalia.

22:28.448 --> 22:32.944
In half a year's time,
Wild Tempest will have regalia.

22:33.616 --> 22:35.120
It's too soon to…

22:35.120 --> 22:35.136
Didn't I tell you?
It's too soon to…

22:35.136 --> 22:36.320
Didn't I tell you?

22:36.736 --> 22:39.920
I'm Overdeath's grandson, Noel Stollen.

22:40.400 --> 22:44.528
I'm going to be the greatest Seeker.

22:44.784 --> 22:46.176
Don't forget it.

22:47.888 --> 22:49.840
Hey! Noel!

22:50.160 --> 22:52.032
Shall we head back to our rooms?

22:52.624 --> 22:56.656
I'm beat. I want a hot bath.

22:56.656 --> 22:59.230
Food first. I'm hungry.

22:59.230 --> 23:02.048
No! Wash off your sweat first.

23:02.048 --> 23:03.264
What kind of girl are you?

23:03.264 --> 23:05.648
Hey, that's sexist!

23:07.184 --> 23:10.736
That temperament. That strong will…

23:12.432 --> 23:15.280
He reminds me of someone.

23:16.160 --> 23:22.000
How will I become the greatest Seeker
as a Talker, the weakest Job?

23:22.800 --> 23:24.528
There's only one answer.

23:26.080 --> 23:28.752
Run the world's greatest clan.

23:30.608 --> 23:32.592
That's my only way.
